      "meaning": "当且仅当满足：环境较暗 且 超声距离在20cm内（且测距有效）时，输出alarm报警串口消息",
      "sample_period_ms": 10,
      "device": "Serial report control",
      "hardware": "{\"kind\": \"report_trigger\"}",
